<title>INDIA: SOCCER-NEHRU GOLD CUP RESULTS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-NEHRU GOLD CUP RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>COCHIN, India 1997-04-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results in the Nehru Gold Cup soccer tournament on Sunday:</p>
<p>China 1 Uzbekistan 1 (halftime 1-0)</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>- China - Sun Zhi 34</p>
<p>Uzbekistan - Alexei Manuylenko 49</p>
<p>Iraq 1 India 0 (1-0)</p>
<p>Scorer - Qahtan Drain 24</p>
</text>
